## Local Setup

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

{% if config.has_backend %}
```bash
cd backend
python -m venv .venv
. .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e '.[dev]'
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```
{% endif %}

{% if config.has_frontend %}
```bash
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
```
{% endif %}

